### Register Regular User

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test User",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Register Organizer

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test Organizer",
    "email": "organizer@example.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "role": "organizer",
    "organizationName": "Nearby Events",
    "phone": "01700000000"
}

### Login

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

###

### Get Profile Without Token

GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/profile

### Login

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

###

### Get Profile With Token

GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YTkzMDdhMWEyM2FkNmVjY2FiNGJjNTkiLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODAyMTM1NSwiZXhwIjoxNzg4NjI2MTU1fQ.Mjcx-FPkNYSfRKhJbyL9qHtRJQX13Ex3cQNPXYje4U8

###

### Upload / Update Profile Picture
# Replace the token below with a fresh one from /login,
# and select-image the file in your REST client.

POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/profile-picture
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profilePicture"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### Delete Profile Picture

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/auth/profile-picture
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE